window.MC_CONTENT_EXTRA.push({"a":"sejuani","b":"locke","win":["Sejuani","Sejuani","Sejuani","Sejuani","Skill","Skill","Sejuani"],"spikes":[{"when":"Level 1","text":"Frost Armor shrugs off his on-hit pressure entirely — his poke plan is dead on arrival."},{"when":"Level 3","text":"Permafrost stuns him mid-trade; his E is a flat 10s exit he cannot recycle."},{"when":"Locke level 6","text":"Purgatory's zone grounds Arctic Assault — walk out before execute-range HP."},{"when":"Two-plus items","text":"Stacked armor and HP make you un-executable and un-duelable — the matchup closes in your favour."}],"wants":{"you":["Frost stacks applied on every trade","Permafrost held for his 10s E dash","HP kept above his execute line after 6"],"foe":["A low-HP window for Purgatory","Your Permafrost baited before he commits","Even stages dragged into burst coinflips"]},"early":"Levels 1 through 5 are simply yours: Frost Armor shrugs off his on-hit pressure, Arctic Assault plus Frost stacks win level 2 onward, and Permafrost cancels his E dash while locking every trade. His whole kit needs a target he can whittle and stick to — you are neither. Push the advantage.","mid":"At 6 and again at his first item, the lane briefly evens: Purgatory gives him a genuine execute threat, so stop coasting at low HP and respect the slow-in. Keep the trades short, keep Frost stacks ticking, and let your tank items arrive — the even window is temporary and it is his only one.","late":"Late game the door shuts: stacked armor and HP make you un-executable and un-duelable, and your R lockdown decides teamfights he can barely participate in. Engage on your terms, chain Permafrost onto his commit, and let the team delete a champion whose execute can no longer find a threshold.","whys":["Your level-1 Frost Armor shrugs off his on-hit pressure entirely — he cannot chip you down.","At 2 Arctic Assault engage and Frost stacks keep you firmly ahead in every exchange.","Level 3 Permafrost stuns him out of any trade, and his E is a flat 10s exit he spends.","Through 4-5 your passive shielding and stun deny every all-in he attempts.","At 6 it briefly evens: his ult threat forces you to respect the execute for the first time.","First item stays even-ish — his burst arrives before your tank items and R lockdown take over.","Late your stacked armor and HP make you un-executable and un-duelable — the matchup is closed."]});
