window.MC_CONTENT_EXTRA.push({"a":"sejuani","b":"masteryi","win":["Sejuani","Sejuani","Sejuani","Sejuani","Sejuani","Skill","Master Yi"],"spikes":[{"when":"Level 1","text":"Arctic Assault knocks him up before Wuju Style or Alpha Strike exist."},{"when":"Level 2","text":"Permafrost stuns Meditate out of its channel and ends any trade he starts."},{"when":"Yi first item","text":"A skill fight: he baits your stun with Alpha Strike's untargetable dash."},{"when":"Yi two items","text":"Wuju Style's true damage ignores your armour; only grouped CC holds him."}],"wants":{"you":["An early lane he cannot farm through","Permafrost held for his Meditate","Fights decided before his full build"],"foe":["Quiet scaling into his item spikes","Your stun baited by Alpha Strike","Highlander up so your slows do nothing"]},"early":"The whole laning phase is yours: Arctic Assault knocks him up at 1, Permafrost locks him from 2, and your tank stats deny every trade through 5. His only out is Alpha Strike (18-20s), untargetable but short — deny his farm, call ganks onto its cooldown, and stack a real lead.","mid":"Around his first item the fight turns honest: Alpha Strike goes untargetable through a mistimed stun, so hold Permafrost until he lands, and stun Meditate out of its channel the moment he tries to heal. Force fights while his build is incomplete — the clock now works for him.","late":"At full build Wuju Style's true damage ignores your armour and Highlander (85s) makes him immune to slows — never sidelane into him. Slows are dead here, stuns are not: hold Permafrost and Glacial Prison for the moment he enters and chain the lockdown so your team deletes him inside it.","whys":["Your Arctic Assault knockup and tank stats beat him outright at level 1.","Permafrost at 2 cancels Meditate's channel and ends his trades.","At 3 your CC chain and kiting keep him from ever reaching a kill.","Through 4-5 your CC beats his 18-20s Alpha Strike and 10s Meditate.","At 6 your CC and the approaching R keep the kill pressure yours.","His first item makes it a skill fight — it hinges on whether he baits your stun and R.","Late Wuju Style's true damage ignores your armour and Highlander (85s) shrugs off your slows."]});
